Social commerce differs from social-assisted commerce in an important way: social commerce means the purchase happens within the platform. Social-assisted commerce means social content influences the purchase, which then happens on an external site. Both matter. The strategic question is where your audience prefers to transact.
Social Commerce Setup Essentials
Catalogue integration: Connect your product database to the platform's commerce manager
